    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HARPOON ARENA - IS A 3D TOP-DOWN TEAM  SHOOTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fight in a compact arena, split in half by the Divisor! Use the Gripper to <strong>pull enemy</strong> robots from the other side and finish them off with your teammates. Feeling Rambo? <strong>Launch yourself</strong> to the enemy side and <span class=\"bb_strike\">die</span>\u00a0<strong>WIPE THEM OUT!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/71846d480b34c5f26a148792e4e81fa1.poster.avif?t=1743788116\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/71846d480b34c5f26a148792e4e81fa1.webm?t=1743788116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/71846d480b34c5f26a148792e4e81fa1.mp4?t=1743788116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf<strong>PRECISION IS KEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Landing a Gripper shot can turn the tide of battle, but don\u2019t forget that your enemies are just as skilled! The battlefield is a chaotic dance of harpoons flying from every direction. <strong>Dodge, strategize, and strike at the perfect moment</strong> to take down your opponents before they take down you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/72aa3486fd1982fa1c4749ba0cda2978.poster.avif?t=1743788116\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/72aa3486fd1982fa1c4749ba0cda2978.webm?t=1743788116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/72aa3486fd1982fa1c4749ba0cda2978.mp4?t=1743788116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1<strong>SWIFT MATCHES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robots are getting enhanced rapidly during the battles. <strong>Make every second</strong> count and be the first to unlock robot's full potential. <strong>You've only got 5 minutes</strong>, so master the chaos and <strong>roll over the enemy team</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/96f10895b1a89b530fa70b78d7d0495a.poster.avif?t=1743788116\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/96f10895b1a89b530fa70b78d7d0495a.webm?t=1743788116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/96f10895b1a89b530fa70b78d7d0495a.mp4?t=1743788116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd27<strong>CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time outside of battle to customize <strong>Magnetron</strong> \u2014 your combat robot. Will you be a deceptive hunter, a swift dodger, or a brute destroyer? Install the modules that match your playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grip. Pull. Dominate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the mayhem in <strong>Harpoon Arena!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HARPOON ARENA - IS A 3D TOP-DOWN TEAM  SHOOTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fight in a compact arena, split in half by the Divisor! Use the Gripper to <strong>pull enemy</strong> robots from the other side and finish them off with your teammates. Feeling Rambo? <strong>Launch yourself</strong> to the enemy side and <span class=\"bb_strike\">die</span>\u00a0<strong>WIPE THEM OUT!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/71846d480b34c5f26a148792e4e81fa1.poster.avif?t=1743788116\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/71846d480b34c5f26a148792e4e81fa1.webm?t=1743788116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/71846d480b34c5f26a148792e4e81fa1.mp4?t=1743788116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf<strong>PRECISION IS KEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Landing a Gripper shot can turn the tide of battle, but don\u2019t forget that your enemies are just as skilled! The battlefield is a chaotic dance of harpoons flying from every direction. <strong>Dodge, strategize, and strike at the perfect moment</strong> to take down your opponents before they take down you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/72aa3486fd1982fa1c4749ba0cda2978.poster.avif?t=1743788116\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/72aa3486fd1982fa1c4749ba0cda2978.webm?t=1743788116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/72aa3486fd1982fa1c4749ba0cda2978.mp4?t=1743788116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1<strong>SWIFT MATCHES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robots are getting enhanced rapidly during the battles. <strong>Make every second</strong> count and be the first to unlock robot's full potential. <strong>You've only got 5 minutes</strong>, so master the chaos and <strong>roll over the enemy team</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/96f10895b1a89b530fa70b78d7d0495a.poster.avif?t=1743788116\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/96f10895b1a89b530fa70b78d7d0495a.webm?t=1743788116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/96f10895b1a89b530fa70b78d7d0495a.mp4?t=1743788116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd27<strong>CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time outside of battle to customize <strong>Magnetron</strong> \u2014 your combat robot. Will you be a deceptive hunter, a swift dodger, or a brute destroyer? Install the modules that match your playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grip. Pull. Dominate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the mayhem in <strong>Harpoon Arena!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "A fast-paced top-down team shooter. The arena is split in half, limiting direct hero contact. Use a harpoon to pull enemies to your side and finish them with teammates! Accuracy and cold calculation will lead you to victory. Just avoid other harpoons flying from all directions...",
